From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] FreeChat: disappearing messages

Rooms opt in with the com.freechat.disappearing state event
({"ttl": seconds}). Messages appended while a TTL is set are indexed
by expiry time in the new expiresat_eventid map; a worker redacts them
as their original sender (marking the redaction com.freechat.expired)
and deletes media the sender uploaded, including MXCs listed in the
plaintext com.freechat.media hint on encrypted events.
